  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "A projectile is fired with a velocity u making an angle $\\theta$ with the horizontal. What is the magnitude of change in velocity when it is at the highest point -",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "kARL8",
      "text": "$u \\cos \\theta$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3kcrl",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{u}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "uSKth",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{u} \\sin \\theta$",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "zm9w3",
      "text": "$\\mathrm{u} \\cos \\theta-\\mathrm{u}$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Initially $\\mathrm{u}=\\cos \\theta \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+\\mathrm{u} \\sin \\theta \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}$.\r\n\r\nAt highest point $\\mathrm{v}=\\mathrm{u} \\cos \\theta \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}$\r\n\r\n$\\therefore$ difference is $\\mathrm{u} \\sin \\theta$",
    "image": null
  },
